# Mobile UI standards (Expo + Tamagui)

**Apps:** `driver-app`, `customer-app`.

**International bar:** WCAG 2.2 AA (contrast, labels, target size), Apple HIG + Material **44×44pt** touch, **8pt spacing grid**, ISO 9241-210 (predictable nav, recoverable errors).

**Design system:** Neo Glass + Soft Dark — `tamagui.config.ts`, overview `claude/docs/mobile/driver/00_OVERVIEW.md`.

**Verify before done:** `npm run verify` in the touched app (typecheck + `scripts/ui-check.sh`).

---

## 1. Which shell to use (mandatory)

| Screen type | Pattern | Example |
|-------------|---------|---------|
| Tab root (home, trips, profile) | Full-bleed or custom map layout — **exception** documented in file header | `index`, map home |
| Sub-screen with back | `<Screen scroll backButton>` | support, faq, edit-profile |
| Sub-screen, no scroll | `<Screen backButton padded={false}>` | rare |
| Auth | Existing auth layout + `GlassButton` | login |
| Modal / sheet | Match sibling modals in same feature | trip offer |

**Never:** bare `View flex={1}` + hand-rolled `ScrollView` + `paddingBottom: 100`.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<View flex={1}><ScrollView contentContainerStyle={{ paddingBottom: 100 }}>

// ✅ GOOD
<Screen scroll backButton>
  <AppText variant="h1">Hỗ trợ</AppText>
</Screen>
```

---

## 2. Spacing scale (8pt grid)

Tamagui tokens — **only these** for margin/padding/gap:

| Token | px | Use |
|-------|-----|-----|
| `$1` | 4 | Icon–text micro gap |
| `$2` | 8 | Inline chip gap, tight rows |
| `$3` | 12 | Compact list item padding |
| `$4` | 16 | Default section inner padding |
| `$5` | 20 | **Screen horizontal gutter** (built into `Screen`) |
| `$6` | 24 | Section gap, card padding |
| `$7` | 28 | Large section separation |
| `$8` | 32 | Hero blocks |
| `$9`–`$10` | 40–48 | Rare vertical rhythm |

**Screen defaults** (`Screen.tsx`): horizontal **20px**, vertical gap **20px**, top **insets.top + 16** (or back-button clearance).

**Floating chrome clearance** — import from `src/constants/layout.ts`, never magic numbers:

| Constant | When |
|----------|------|
| `SCROLL_TAB_BAR_CLEARANCE` | Scrollable tab screens (bottom padding) |
| `MAP_OVERLAY_BOTTOM_CLEARANCE` | Bottom-anchored map overlays (route panel, HUD) |
| `TOP_CLEARANCE_BELOW_CHAT_BUTTON` | Top overlays on home below chat toggle |

---

## 3. Color & theme tokens

Use Tamagui **semantic** tokens — not raw hex in screens/components:

| Role | Token |
|------|--------|
| Page background | `$background` |
| Card / elevated surface | `$surfaceElevated`, `$card` |
| Primary text | `$textPrimary` |
| Secondary / meta | `$textSecondary`, `$textMuted` |
| Brand accent | `$primary`, `$primaryPress` |
| CTA gradient | `$gradientStart`, `$gradientEnd` |
| Success / warning / danger | `$success`, `$warning`, `$danger` |
| Borders (sparse) | `$outline`, `$divider` |

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<Text color="#8B5CF6">
<Ionicons color="#34d399" />

// ✅ GOOD
<AppText color="$primary">
<Ionicons color={theme.success.val} />  // useTheme() for non-Tamagui APIs
```

**Allowed hex exceptions:** map markers, third-party map layers, Skia/canvas — comment why.

**Both themes:** every changed surface must read clearly in **light AND dark** (WCAG AA ~4.5:1 body on background).

Brand anchor: `#8B5CF6` primary — defined once in `tamagui.config.ts`.

---

## 4. Typography (`AppText` only)

**Never** ad-hoc `fontSize: 11` or `fontWeight` on text — pick a variant:

| Variant | Size | Use |
|---------|------|-----|
| `display` | 28 | Big numbers, hero stats |
| `h1` | 22 | Screen title |
| `h2` | 18 | Section / card title |
| `title` | 16 | List row title |
| `body` | 15 | Default copy |
| `bodyStrong` | 15 | Emphasis in paragraph |
| `label` | 13 | Field labels, meta |
| `caption` | 12 | Timestamps, hints — **minimum readable size** |

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<Text fontSize={11} fontWeight="700">Trang chủ</Text>

// ✅ GOOD
<AppText variant="caption" color="$textSecondary">Trang chủ</AppText>
```

Tab bar labels: **12px** minimum (`LiquidGlassTabBar`).

**Exception:** route tabs (Trang chủ, Chuyến, …) are **icon-only** — meaning is carried by the icon + `accessibilityLabel`; center **Trợ lý AI** slot keeps its caption under the orb.

---

## 5. Touch & accessibility (WCAG + HIG)

| Rule | Requirement |
|------|-------------|
| Min touch target | **44×44pt** on every primary control |
| `Pressable` / `TouchableOpacity` | `accessibilityRole` + descriptive `accessibilityLabel` (Vietnamese for driver UI) |
| Expandable rows | `accessibilityState={{ expanded }}` |
| Icon-only buttons | Label describes action, not icon name ("Mở trò chuyện", not "chatbubble") |
| Reduce motion | Respect `AccessibilityInfo.isReduceMotionEnabled()` for decorative animation |

**Reference implementations:** `BackButton`, `ChatToggleButton`, `AssistantTabButton` (hitSlop 8).

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — 32pt icon button
<Pressable style={{ width: 32, height: 32 }}>

// ✅ GOOD
<Pressable
  style={{ width: 44, height: 44, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}
  accessibilityRole="button"
  accessibilityLabel="Quay lại"
>
```

