## 6. Component picker

| Need | Use | Avoid |
|------|-----|-------|
| Standard screen | `Screen` | Raw View + ScrollView |
| Text | `AppText` | Tamagui `Text` with manual sizes |
| Primary button | `Button` | Raw Pressable styled ad hoc |
| Auth / glass CTA | `GlassButton` | MUI-style filled rect on glass |
| Text field | `Input`, `GlassAuthInput` | Unstyled TextInput |
| Card / panel | `Card`, `Surface` | View + shadow one-off |
| Glass floating control | `GlassMaterial` + `useGlassPress` | Skia shader (removed — use BlurView stack) |
| Back nav | `BackButton` or `<Screen backButton>` | Custom chevron per screen |
| Badge | `Badge` | Inline styled View |

**Glass rule:** `Card` uses `GlassSheen` (no blur). Floating controls (tab bar, back, assistant orb) use `GlassMaterial`.

---

## 7. Tab bar & assistant orb

- Tab bar: `LiquidGlassTabBar` — floating island, **do not** hardcode bottom padding without clearance constants.
- **Route tabs:** icon-only (no caption) — icons at **26px**; `accessibilityLabel` from route `title` (Vietnamese) for screen readers.
- **Active tab pill:** fill/tint only (`backgroundColor`) — **never** add a `borderWidth` stroke on the pill; the bar already has a 1px glass rim (`GLASS_BORDER_COLOR`). Stacking both reads as overlapping/double borders (worst at first/last tab corners, e.g. Trang chủ).
- **Edge clearance:** first/last tab pill must inset **`PILL_BAR_EDGE_INSET` (12px)** from the bar's rounded outer edge; middle tabs use **`PILL_SLOT_INSET` (4px)** — pill must not "chạm thành" the bar rim.
- Center **Trợ lý AI**: `AssistantTabButton` + `AssistantTabLabel` — mic when idle, waves when connected, purple brand gradient.
- Web preview (`driver-app` on Expo web) is **approximate** for map/orb — **device/simulator is authoritative** for pixels.

---

## 8. Forms & feedback

- Labels above fields (`AppText variant="label"`).
- Errors: `$danger` text + clear message — not color alone.
- Submit: disable while loading; show activity indicator.
- Destructive: confirm `Alert.alert` before irreversible actions.

---

## 9. Motion & performance

- Decorative orb/spin animation: **off when idle** on web; respect reduce motion on native.
- Prefer Reanimated / CSS for motion; avoid 60fps JS loops updating many nodes.
- No `filter: blur` stacks on web tab bar (CPU) — see `AssistantTabButton.web.tsx` pattern.

---

## 10. Anti-patterns (reject in review)

- `paddingBottom: 100` or any hardcoded tab clearance
- `fontSize: 11` anywhere in `app/` or `src/features/`
- `#8B5CF6`, `#7C3AED`, `#34d399` literals in feature screens
- `IconButton` / pressable under 44pt for primary actions
- New screen without `Screen` shell (unless full-bleed exception comment)
- Duplicating layout math instead of importing `layout.ts`
- Light-only colors that vanish in dark theme

`scripts/ui-check.sh` catches some of these — run `npm run verify`.

---

## 11. Definition of done (mobile UI)

- [ ] Correct shell (`Screen` / documented exception)
- [ ] Spacing from `$1`–`$10` or layout constants
- [ ] `AppText` variants; no 11px text
- [ ] Semantic color tokens; light + dark checked
- [ ] Touch targets ≥ 44pt; a11y labels on interactives
- [ ] `npm run verify` passes
- [ ] Visual check on **iOS or Android** for layout/orb/map changes

See also: `ui-web.mdc`, `quality-standards.mdc`.
